  "description": "Follow-up from TASK-7.4 (doc-19) reviews. gradeDecision accepts a hand-built recommendation with non-finite equity and grades it Minor with a NaN margin, which would serialise as null in a hand record. A wrong-way margin is only tested at -5, so a Math.abs mutant survives. One test name claims a float trap (26.7-16.7) that is exact in floating point.",
